WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:06.840
The SCP Foundation has a long history of experience
with humanoid anomalies, from simple reality

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:13.470
benders like SCP-239 to strange transplants
from other universes like SCP-2273.

00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:20.540
But one of the oldest, strangest, and most
lethal humanoid anomalies in the Foundation’s

00:00:20.540 --> 00:00:26.320
considerable cabinet isn’t a superhuman
or a soldier - it’s a man known only as

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:27.700
“Herr Chirurg”.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:34.030
On first glance, SCP-542’s containment protocol
is seemingly standard - he is allowed to request

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:39.000
personal items and furniture for his cell,
so long as they are blunt and cannot be used

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.730
to cut skin.

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:44.280
Reasonable enough, and many such requests
have been granted.

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:49.250
The ones denied include nail files, clippers,
and a surgery kit which has been set aside

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.010
for testing only.

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:55.930
But continuing, SCP-542 requires some special
attention too.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:01:00.640
A blood transfusion every week on request,
and even an organ transplant conducted by

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:05.300
Foundation doctors should any of his own organs
begin to fail.

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:10.869
SCP-542 offers to do the surgery himself,
but is repeatedly denied.

00:01:10.869 --> 00:01:15.630
To understand the story of Herr Chirurg, we
must look back through time to several years

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:19.049
before SCP-542’s containment.

00:01:19.049 --> 00:01:23.319
Over the past three years, there have been
a violent string of murders across America,

00:01:23.319 --> 00:01:25.069
England, and Germany.

00:01:25.069 --> 00:01:30.369
INTERPOL and the FBI are stumped, not only
by the wide range of attacks - anywhere from

00:01:30.369 --> 00:01:36.459
forty-five to sixty murders across three countries
- but by the brutal nature of the attacks.

00:01:36.459 --> 00:01:41.779
The victims were found in various states of
disassembly, body parts missing and tissue

00:01:41.779 --> 00:01:42.779
removed.

00:01:42.779 --> 00:01:48.069
They set up crime scenes and conducted complex
investigations, but they were simply unable

00:01:48.069 --> 00:01:50.060
to find their man.

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:54.759
In one month, four people in Germany were
assaulted, with the muscle, tissue, and bone

00:01:54.759 --> 00:01:57.169
removed from all of their limbs.

00:01:57.169 --> 00:02:01.920
Three of them died from their injuries before
help could arrive, and the fourth was an American

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:05.079
woman staying at a shady German hotel.

00:02:05.079 --> 00:02:09.810
The only reason she narrowly survived the
horrific attack was because of the actions

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:13.770
of her neighbor, a Foundation agent passing
through town.

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:17.880
He heard sounds of fighting in the room next
door at three in the morning, and broke the

00:02:17.880 --> 00:02:23.950
door down to help, unaware of the horrific
scene he would find: a huge, misshapen man,

00:02:23.950 --> 00:02:26.790
best-described as a “Frankenstein’s monster”.

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:32.930
His skin was a patchwork of different shades
stitched and grafted together, his chest was

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:39.390
sunken in, his arms were grotesquely long
for his body and his face was skeletal and

00:02:39.390 --> 00:02:40.390
gaunt.

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:46.110
This creature, that would come to be named
SCP-542, was hunched over the fully-conscious

00:02:46.110 --> 00:02:50.160
woman, vivisecting her leg to remove the sinew
and bone.

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:53.860
In shock, the agent pulled his weapon and
fired at the creature, which escaped through

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:55.600
the window unharmed.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:03:00.780
The authorities were called and the woman
survived, although without her right leg.

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:05.720
Just before being amnesticized, the woman
provided a statement to the Foundation:

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:10.120
She had been staying in Germany for a few
days when she saw a strange man on her usual

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.570
bus one day.

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:16.600
Even though it was summer, the man was draped
and wrapped in layers of heavy coats, jackets

00:03:16.600 --> 00:03:17.720
and a hat.

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:22.360
Though his face completely obscured, the woman
could tell he was staring at her from the

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:24.050
back of the bus.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:28.320
Thinking it was just some creep, she ignored
him and got off at her stop.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:33.319
For three days, she continued to take the
bus and ignore the strange man sitting in

00:03:33.319 --> 00:03:34.319
the back.

00:03:34.319 --> 00:03:39.210
Then, on the fourth day, when she got off
the bus that night and went to her hotel room,

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:44.280
she found the window open and the lights off,
and assumed she had been burglarized.

00:03:44.280 --> 00:03:49.360
But as soon as she opened the door, she realized
she wasn’t alone.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:54.100
Two freakishly long arms with disjointed hands
grabbed her ankles from under the bed and

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.420
brought her crashing to the floor.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:04:00.510
Before she knew what was happening, she was
tied to the bed, and the hulking hunchback

00:04:00.510 --> 00:04:04.590
was retrieving a surgical set and sharpening
his knives and tools.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:09.459
Fearing the worst, she began to scream, and
the Agent heard her - but by the time he broke

00:04:09.459 --> 00:04:14.550
in and shot his weapon, the creature had already
done too much damage to her leg.

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:19.519
The victim was amnesticized and told her leg
had been amputated in a car crash.

00:04:19.519 --> 00:04:23.831
The Foundation took over the investigation
from Interpol, realizing this wasn’t some

00:04:23.831 --> 00:04:28.729
regular serial killer - this was a creature,
a predator.

00:04:28.729 --> 00:04:33.720
And to find it, they had to hunt SCP-542 like
a predator.

00:04:33.720 --> 00:04:40.259
After a long tracking and manhunt across Europe,
SCP-542 was brought into Foundation custody,

00:04:40.259 --> 00:04:43.820
and research into this creature could begin.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:51.550
The researchers were expecting an animal or
monster, something they could study and dissect.

00:04:51.550 --> 00:04:56.229
Which is why they were so shocked when the
monster began speaking in tongues - German,

00:04:56.229 --> 00:05:01.830
French, Polish, before settling on English,
all in a sharp German accent.

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:07.940
The beast was introducing itself – “Herr
Chirurg”, German for “Mister Surgeon”.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:13.659
Preliminary investigations revealed much about
SCP-542, and confirmed the agent’s initial

00:05:13.659 --> 00:05:15.449
impression was correct.

00:05:15.449 --> 00:05:19.000
Herr Chirurg is a modern Frankenstein’s
monster.

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:24.430
His anatomy has been warped and malformed
- as the agent observed, his skin is a patchwork

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:29.949
of large chunks of skin grafted or sewn to
each other, no two of which seem to come from

00:05:29.949 --> 00:05:31.289
the same person.

00:05:31.289 --> 00:05:36.860
His ribcage is warped and twisted with all
the ribs jutting out in different directions,

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:42.520
and both his arms are different sizes - though
both are incredibly muscular and far too long

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:43.889
for his body.

00:05:43.889 --> 00:05:49.999
Attached to each is a hand, but filled with
far more joints than any normal hand, allowing

00:05:49.999 --> 00:05:53.600
him to bend his fingers in almost any direction.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:58.770
His spine is hunched and twisted like a snake,
and the skin stretched tight over his skull

00:05:58.770 --> 00:06:05.069
reveals a sunken cranium and a mouth with
far, far too many teeth - none of them from

00:06:05.069 --> 00:06:09.039
the same source, and not all of them human.

00:06:09.039 --> 00:06:14.319
And these are all simply the externally obvious
and most grotesque modifications.

00:06:14.319 --> 00:06:19.300
Foundation staff have conducted intense medical
research, ranging from X-rays to comprehensive

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:21.219
DNA testing.

00:06:21.219 --> 00:06:26.580
SCP-542’s bone and muscle structures are
asymmetrical, revealing the left and right

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:29.139
sides of his body come from different sources.

00:06:29.139 --> 00:06:33.979
In fact, they reveal that almost all of his
organs and body parts have been replaced with

00:06:33.979 --> 00:06:36.249
other body parts from different sources.

00:06:36.249 --> 00:06:43.199
His DNA is heavily fragmented beyond all logic
- by any reasonable measure, SCP-542 should

00:06:43.199 --> 00:06:45.080
have died a long time ago.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:51.469
Instead, he is able to accept many blood types
and organ transplants without so much as discomfort,

00:06:51.469 --> 00:06:56.229
much less the serious autoimmune response
that any normal person would get.

00:06:56.229 --> 00:07:00.520
Not to mention, he is able to stay perfectly
aware even while performing complex brain

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:02.249
surgery on himself.

00:07:02.249 --> 00:07:08.039
Herr Chirurg’s history is as enigmatic and
mysterious as the question of how he remains

00:07:08.039 --> 00:07:09.050
alive.

00:07:09.050 --> 00:07:13.289
He claims he was once a simple doctor from
Germany, ‘dreadfully normal’ until the

00:07:13.289 --> 00:07:14.860
Great War began.

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:19.380
The Foundation has deduced this to mean that
he began his modifications to his body between

00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:24.471
the World Wars, but it appears Herr Chirug
wasn’t just a monster on the outside; he

00:07:24.471 --> 00:07:30.719
claims to have worked for the Nazis in World
War 2 as they conducted brutal human experimentation,

00:07:30.719 --> 00:07:33.139
which he described as ‘boring’.

00:07:33.139 --> 00:07:38.839
The exact nature and timeline of how he modified
himself without dying at some point is similarly

00:07:38.839 --> 00:07:42.460
mysterious - he professes that he didn’t
work alone.

00:07:42.460 --> 00:07:47.319
For more complex surgeries, such as implanting
his second heart or replacing parts of his

00:07:47.319 --> 00:07:50.289
spinal cord, he had a team of ‘helpers’.

00:07:50.289 --> 00:07:56.509
Who and where these surgical assistants are
now is a mystery – if they’re even alive.

00:07:56.509 --> 00:08:01.280
After all, the Foundation has ample evidence
Herr Chirurg is able and willing to kill people

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:02.909
for their parts.

00:08:02.909 --> 00:08:08.360
After all this exhaustive research on SCP-542,
you’d be forgiven for thinking that he is

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:14.039
some kind of mad scientist, driven insane
by his experimentation on his own body.

00:08:14.039 --> 00:08:19.419
While no one can answer why Chirurg kills
except himself, he is almost frighteningly

00:08:19.419 --> 00:08:20.550
sane.

00:08:20.550 --> 00:08:25.699
This hulking monstrosity enjoys reading his
anatomy textbooks, which he requests on a

00:08:25.699 --> 00:08:29.999
regular basis, along with filling out crossword
puzzles in German.

00:08:29.999 --> 00:08:34.760
He’s friendly, too - described as ‘surprisingly
pleasant’ by the research team.

00:08:34.760 --> 00:08:39.270
He holds long, intellectual conversations
on topics ranging from science and biology

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:45.440
in medicine to politics and history, which
he seems to recount with startling accuracy.

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:50.090
In fact, tissue testing has failed to return
a definitive age for the Surgeon.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:54.510
He’s incredibly skilled at the game of chess,
and the research team is allowed to play with

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.020
him as a method of interview.

00:08:57.020 --> 00:09:03.330
SCP-542 displays fluency in a variety of European
languages, though he prefers his supposedly

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.330
native German.

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:10.130
At first, the research team was enthused with
his presence, even if he was a little terrifying

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:14.870
- having a brilliant doctor to converse with
was a great distraction for them.

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:20.410
His ability to heal from intense surgery with
almost no organ rejection or allergic reactions

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:25.200
was considered a medical miracle, and rather
than locking him up and throwing away the

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:30.460
key, the research team decided to use him
to try and harness this incredible power for

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:31.990
modern medicine.

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:36.580
His books and notes, captured along with him,
reveal surgical techniques and methods far

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:40.780
more advanced than considered possible when
they were written.

00:09:40.780 --> 00:09:46.820
For his part, SCP-542 was happy to comply
- he enjoyed performing surgery on himself

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:51.810
with an audience, using himself as a living
cadaver to explain his manner of surgery and

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:53.820
the functions of the body.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:58.710
Unfortunately, observing him this close carried
a risk none of the researchers realized until

00:09:58.710 --> 00:10:00.140
it was too late.

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:03.900
You see, Herr Chirurg isn’t just a friendly
old surgeon.

00:10:03.900 --> 00:10:08.750
His body runs off second-hand parts, and is
constantly failing.

00:10:08.750 --> 00:10:14.600
Organs stop functioning, blood flow ceases,
parts of his body grow gangrenous and necrotic.

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:20.520
SCP-542 is able to anomalously detect when
this is happening - he is perfectly and acutely

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:24.750
aware of his own body functions like digestion
and peristalsis.

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:30.580
And he knows exactly when one of his organs
is starting to give up or his flesh is beginning

00:10:30.580 --> 00:10:31.730
to decay.

00:10:31.730 --> 00:10:35.780
When this happens, the Surgeon undergoes a
drastic transformation.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.340
His pleasant exterior evaporates.

00:10:38.340 --> 00:10:43.400
He grows moody and withdrawn, snapping at
people and avoiding conversation.

00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:48.260
He spends long periods of time observing people,
using his ability to sense how well their

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:49.260
body is.

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:53.010
And then, when he senses an opening, he strikes.

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:56.790
Just like his murders in Europe, he picks
the body of his victims clean of the body

00:10:56.790 --> 00:11:00.120
parts he needs and lets them die of blood
loss.

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:04.880
Then he performs the surgery to replace his
own failing organs with the new ones, and

00:11:04.880 --> 00:11:08.050
returns to his usual demeanor.

00:11:08.050 --> 00:11:12.330
This monstrous Jekyll-Hyde relationship isn’t
purely need-based, either.

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:16.610
The research team has discovered that Herr
Chirurg will also dissect people simply for

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:18.110
the joy of the act.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:23.100
In one regrettable incident, a sewing kit
was left behind in his cell.

00:11:23.100 --> 00:11:28.850
Several hours later, guards discovered a D-class
sewn to the mattress in SCP-542’s cell,

00:11:28.850 --> 00:11:32.770
with the Surgeon carefully and gleefully extracting
his organs.

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:39.730
SCP-542, “Herr Chirurg”, is a walking
encyclopedia of medical and surgical knowledge.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:45.350
But all that knowledge comes from experimentation
on himself and on unwilling victims - the

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:50.650
Foundation has put him to use in certain projects,
but all activity with him is to be strictly

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:52.910
monitored and regulated.

00:11:52.910 --> 00:12:00.530
Despite appearances, SCP-542 isn’t a person
- he’s a predator and an exceptionally skilled

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.540
and dangerous one at that.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:07.631
One moment of inattentiveness can result in
a fate much worse than death around him - but

00:12:07.631 --> 00:12:13.149
you can rest assured that if something does
happen, your parts won’t go to waste.

00:12:13.149 --> 00:12:19.770
Now go check out “SCP-049 - the Plague Doctor
Captured (SCP Animation &amp; Story)” and “SCP

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:26.180
Immortal Dr. Bright Explained (SCP Animation)
for more Anomalous SCP Doctors!

